stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DECLARED
    DECLARED --> CHECKING: intent + observation loaded
    CHECKING --> BLOCKED_IDENTITY: identity drift
    CHECKING --> BLOCKED_STAGE: stage missing/order/state
    CHECKING --> BLOCKED_ARTIFACT: artifact or QA gap
    CHECKING --> BLOCKED_BOUNDARY: external boundary drift
    CHECKING --> DELIVERY_READY: all contract checks pass
    DELIVERY_READY --> HANDOFF_READY: owner + decision + idempotency
    HANDOFF_READY --> [*]
    BLOCKED_IDENTITY --> [*]
    BLOCKED_STAGE --> [*]
    BLOCKED_ARTIFACT --> [*]
    BLOCKED_BOUNDARY --> [*]
